# <wtl> project: c4 | file: .scanignore | author: watchthelight </wtl>
# Globs (fnmatch, relative to the repo root) that scripts/scan.py skips. Only fixture directories whose
# files must contain fake secrets, socket names or process start times belong here, plus two generated
# files that carry third-party text: the notices, whose license texts name their authors' addresses,
# and the pnpm lock file, whose deprecation notices do the same; everything else in fixtures/ is still
# scanned.
fixtures/home/sessions/*
fixtures/home/daemon/*
fixtures/home/jobs/*
THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md
pnpm-lock.yaml
